"kill",
"Once everything is set up, launch:\n'C:\Users\[USERNAME]\Documents\Wind Waker AP\The Wind Waker Archipelago Randomizer.exe', the setup should have filled the input fields automatically. Click 'Randomize', a new .iso file should be created inside the 'Installation Path' you have selected.\n\nOpen 'Dolphin.exe' and drag the randomized .iso file that was just created into the Dolphin window and it should start the randomized Archipelago ROM.\n\nFinally, simply go to the Archipelago Launcher and look for the 'Wind Waker Client' and connect to it while having Dolphin open with the randomized file injected!",
